<title>USA: Coherent Chairman Hobart to resign.</title>
<headline>Coherent Chairman Hobart to resign.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coherent Inc Thursday said James Hobart will resign as chairman, director and chief technical officer of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Hobart will remain with the company until March 3l, to assure an orderly transition. The company said Hobart is leaving Coherent to pursue other personal interests.</p>
<p>The company said its board of directors will meet within a week to select a new chairman.</p>
</text>
